---
title: "Sequence 2 - Coordinator returns / approves / rejects (SCRUM-25/26/27/51)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Co as Assigned Coordinator
    participant API as events.py<br/>POST /events/{id}/return | approve | reject
    participant SR as status_rules.py<br/>change_status
    participant N as notifications.py
    participant DB as Database

    Co->>API: decision (+ note / reason)
    API->>API: body check: return & reject need a non-blank note (else 422)
    API->>API: role must be coordinator (else 403)
    API->>DB: load Event (else 404)

    API->>SR: change_status(event, new_status, coordinator, reason)
    SR->>SR: is (current -> new) in TRANSITIONS?
    alt move not allowed from current status
        SR-->>API: InvalidTransition
        API-->>Co: 400
    else caller is not the assigned coordinator
        SR-->>API: NotPermitted
        API-->>Co: 403
    end
    SR->>DB: set status, add EventStatusHistory (actor, reason)
    SR-->>API: ok

    API->>N: notify_organiser_of_status(new_status, note)
    N->>DB: add Notification -> Organiser<br/>returned: includes note / approved / rejected: includes reason

    API->>DB: commit (status + history + notification together)
    API-->>Co: 200 {status}
    Note over API,N: A refused action raises before notify, so it never sends a notification
